    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7550001",
            "objective": "Watch the Children of Echoes' dance event",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "755000101",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wow..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000102",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "As it turns out, the Children of Echoes sure can dance! Paimon never thought the human body could perform the motions they did onstage!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000103",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "The rhythmic music, the exciting fireworks... All of that combined brings a totally different vibe from anything we've seen so far!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000104",
                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                    "text": "#Well said, radiant {M#sir}{F#lady}, and your wow-warbling floating doll, too!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000105",
                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                    "text": "Sharp senses, and distinguished, too... Yes. I'm sure you have what it takes to be the vanguard of avant-garde, and a rising star amongst graffiti artists!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000106",
                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                    "text": "So, how about it? Wanna join me, the Dopey Dazzler, in grasping the latest and greatest in trendy artistic thought?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "755000107",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wow, here comes another person with an odd nickname!",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "755000108",
                            "text": "Wow, you really do \"wow\" a lot.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "755000110",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Don't even try changing the subject! This isn't about the \"wow\" factor or a silly nickname. The important part is what this girl was talking about."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000111",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "\"Avant-garde thought\"... Is that the key to Natlan's artistic uniqueness?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000112",
                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                    "text": "Ah, there we go. Very perceptive!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000113",
                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                    "text": "As you can see, the vibrant dances, the frenetic music, the vivid graffiti... All of this has deep connections to the avant-garde."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000114",
                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                    "text": "Fashions, trends, novelty... To us, these are synonyms of \"avant-garde.\""
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000115",
                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                    "text": "As for me, the Dopey Dazzler, mainstay of the Graffiti Alliance, I'm trying to encourage a greater understanding of such forward thinking. First Natlan, then the world!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "755000116",
                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                    "text": "That way, art will constantly evolve, and works of extraordinary aesthetic value may be produced! Ever upwards and on for large-scale graffiti work!",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "755000117",
                                            "text": "I don't quite get it.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000119",
                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                    "text": "A more specific example, then. See the large work of graffiti in the stage backdrop? I was involved in drawing that."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000120",
                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                    "text": "If that backdrop was a realistic landscape painting, a fine oil painting from Fontaine, or a mural from Sumeru..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000121",
                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                    "text": "Do you think it would still fit?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000122",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Huh, okay, that's pretty straightforward. Paimon gets it now."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000123",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "So if the backdrop's patterns and colors weren't as explosive, it would feel less... energetic?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000124",
                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                    "text": "Of course, I wouldn't claim that landscape, oil, or wall paintings are bad, but when you need to emphasize vivid tension and burning soul, there's nothing quite like graffiti!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000125",
                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                    "text": "If you ask me, every tribe here in Natlan has the impulse to strive ever higher, the desire to pursue strength — that's why avant-garde is our primary style!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "755000126",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Y'know, you call yourself \"dopey,\" but you're pretty knowledgeable, aren't you?",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "755000127",
                                                            "text": "Are you going to take us on as students?",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "755000129",
                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                    "text": "Whoa, whoa, an old hand at this song-and-dance, are we?"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "755000130",
                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                    "text": "Don't worry, I'm not too fussed about all that master-student stuff, and I don't care about fortune or fame either. What we do here is share our experiences, in the hope that they will bloom and bear fruit everywhere."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "755000131",
                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                    "text": "As long as you can grasp the essence of avant-garde and create the inspired works of graffiti required, I'll be satisfied."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "755000132",
                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                    "text": "In fact, I'd even cough up as much Mora and material as it took to help you grow into a graffiti master!"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "755000133",
                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                    "text": "And then, you can help me with sketches.",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "755000134",
                                                                            "text": "Me? Sketches?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000136",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "You could also help me promote this art elsewhere and attract more talent to our Alliance."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000137",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "After all, our goal is to create unparalleled avant-garde work on every mountain! Currently though, we number at just over ten people, and that's just not going to hack it."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000138",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "My back and waist... *sigh* If I had to carry dyes and paints all day, my bones would be left crooked, and my shoulders and thighs a mess too, no doubt."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000139",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "Paimon was going to say that there seemed to be something fishy about all this..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000140",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "But since you're being so honest, guess there can't be anything too off here."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000141",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "#And y'know, {NICKNAME}, learning graffiti art doesn't sound so bad. We could probably draw something to mark our territory and scare off monsters and baddies!"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000142",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "Haha, yes! That's the spirit! In that case, let's get to it."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000143",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "Now, our work isn't too strict about painting skills — it's all about the mindset. Let us begin, therefore, by taking the measure of avant-garde."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000144",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "The \"measure\"? You mean the \"principles\"?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000145",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "Close enough! In short, we need to find the inspiration to break out of our constraints and express ourselves freely."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000146",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "Once you have done this, you'll be able to seize upon the scenery even amidst a speedrun challenge, and discover the limits of human movement in the midst of close-quarter combat, just as I do."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000147",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "That way, you'll discover the exaggerated line-work you need for graffiti."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000148",
                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                    "text": "As for color schemes, we make use of combinations found in the natural world. You'll be surprised how many surprises it has in store..."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "755000149",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "This sounds familiar... But there's something a bit off...",
                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "755000150",
                                                                                            "text": "Observing lines of motion while racing and fighting.",
                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "755000152",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                                    "text": "These methods of studying \"aesthetics\" really are kinda different. Guess that's Natlan for you..."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "755000153",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                                    "text": "Anyway, take this guidebook and this Kamera, and go forth throughout Natlan. Might as well enjoy the unique sights and sounds while you learn, eh?"
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "755000154",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "\"Dopey Dazzler\"",
                                                                                                    "text": "And once you're back, I'll use what you've seen and heard to help come up with an avant-garde philosophy you can best understand!"
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "755000151",
                                                                                            "text": "Collecting materials and studying colors."
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "755000135",
                                                                            "text": "Hmm? Is that how you get your hands on new assistants?"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "755000128",
                                                            "text": "What's your hourly rate?"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "755000118",
                                            "text": "Seems a bit abstract."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "755000109",
                            "text": "You're not beating the \"wow-warbler\" allegations."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}